{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014YywUfDhQCUUbq94tmoCw3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# event-gated-adaptive-horizon — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 20:54 UTC | 更新原因: Paper Agent 完成 6/7 Dream 结构性修复，TCN narrative supplementary queued\\\\n\\\\n> **Target**: CoRL 2026 (DDL 2026-05-29, 剩余 9 天)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**D113 确认：Scenario B — Intervention Hierarchy 论文**\\\\n核心贡献：三层干预框架（Gradient → Output → Representation）系统性评估 CIVO 干预，证明 CIVO 是 imagination-based bootstrapping 的结构性脆弱性。\\\\n\\\\n因果链：Trained dt_emb → multi-rate exposure → RSSM fidelity gap → reward bias → critic overestimation → collapse\\\\nNVE 诊断指标：AUROC=0.971 (n=29, CI: 0.904-1.000), Youden θ*=1.53\\\\n\\\\n## Dream Full 结果 + 修复进度\\\\n**三档均 5/10** → **Reviewer Round 2 预估 5.5/10 (Borderline)**\\\\n\\\\n| 弱点 | 处理方式 | 状态 |\\\\n|------|---------|------|\\\\n| 缺标准过估值对策讨论 | analysis.tex 新段落（estimation error vs model fidelity gap 区分） | ✅ done |\\\\n| 参考文献过少 | 25 → 55 条，related_work 3 段 | ✅ done |\\\\n| 新颖性论证不锐利 | 贡献列表锐化，MPC boundary 提升为 #2 | ✅ done |\\\\n| NVE 循环验证 | conclusion limitations 添加 caveat | ✅ done |\\\\n| 缺 pixel obs 讨论 | conclusion limitations 添加 | ✅ done |\\\\n| CoRL 相关性弱 | intro 添加 robotics 连接段落 | ✅ done |\\\\n| TCN narrative 弱化 | Paper Agent 待处理 supplementary | 🔄 queued |\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n\\\\n**运行中实验：**\\\\n- 🔄 exp_029b（Walker σ=0.2 s2）— ~95K/210K, NVE=2.11 CIVO confirmed, eval=45\\\\n- 🔄 exp_029d（Walker σ=0.2 s3）— ~15K/210K\\\\n- 🔄 exp_030c（Cheetah σ=1.0）— ~130K/210K, impossible dose\\\\n- 🔄 exp_031（PickCube σ=0.2）— ~145K/200K, negative\\\\n\\\\n**待部署：** PickCube σ=0.5 → exp_031 完成后\\\\n\\\\n## Round 1→2 覆盖度 (4/10 → 预估 5.5)\\\\n\\\\n| 问题 | 覆盖率 | 状态 |\\\\n|------|--------|------|\\\\n| W-C5 模板 | 100% ✅ | 已切 PMLR |\\\\n| W-C4 NVE post-hoc | 95% ✅ | AUROC=0.971 |\\\\n| W-W1 无方案 | 85% | Intervention Hierarchy |\\\\n| W-C2 统计力 | 70% ⚠️ | Walker s2 CIVO confirmed, s3 运行中 |\\\\n| W-C3 泛化性 | 45% ⚠️ | TCN cross-env 全失败 |\\\\n| W-C1 Venue fit | 45% ⚠️ | PickCube + intro robotics 段落 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] Dream full 报告分析 (D116)\\\\n- [x] Paper Agent P0: 标准对策讨论 + 参考文献扩展\\\\n- [x] Paper Agent P1: 新颖性 + NVE + pixel + CoRL\\\\n- [ ] **Paper Agent: TCN narrative \\\\\\\"diagnostic contrast\\\\\\\" 弱化** (supplementary queued)\\\\n- [ ] **监控 4 实验完成**（Agent 正在检查状态）\\\\n- [ ] **PickCube σ=0.5 部署**\\\\n- [ ] **Re-dream 验证**（TCN 修复完成后立即执行）\\\\n- [ ] 论文收尾 — 5/25 数据锁定\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **bjb1-40020**: 2×RTX 4090 — exp_029d s3 (cuda:0) + exp_029b s2 (cuda:1)\\\\n- **bjb1-45299**: 2×RTX PRO 6000 — exp_030c Cheetah σ=1.0 (cuda:0) + exp_031 PickCube (cuda:1)\\\\n- **已申请云 GPU**: 等 Manager 审批\\\\n\\\\n## 实验统计\\\\n完成 95+ | 运行中 4 | 成功 40 / 负向 23 / 失败 11\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D116 | 2026-05-20 | D116: Dream full report (dream_20260520T155150) 分析 | — |\\\\n| D115 | 2026-05-20 | D115: 部署 Walker σ=0.2 s3 (exp_029d) — 4 seeds 匹配 4 | exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01, exp_029b_tcn_walker_s2_sigma02, exp_029d_tcn_walker_s3_sigma02 |\\\\n| D114 | 2026-05-20 | D114: 部署 Walker σ=0.2 s2 (exp_029b) 解决 TCN seed va | exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02, exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02, exp_029b_tcn_walker_s2_sigma02 |\\\\n| D113 | 2026-05-20 | D113: Scenario A 关闭 → Scenario B 确认。TCN Walker 2/2 | exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02, exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05, exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02, exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01 |\\\\n| D112 | 2026-05-20 | D112: Round 1 覆盖度评估完成 + PickCube TCN 升为 P1 + GPU 部 | exp_019a, exp_019b, exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05, exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02 |\\\\n| D111 | 2026-05-20 | D111: σ=0.2 s0 GO 确认 + Cheetah σ=0.2 早期失败信号 → 部署 C | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02, exp_030a_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma02 |\\\\n| D110 | 2026-05-20 | D110: 双场景 framing 确定——A: \\\\\\\"first effective CIVO int | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02, exp_027_tcn_walker_s0, exp_028_rave_walker_s0, exp_025_obs_sgs_walker_s1 |\\\\n| D109 | 2026-05-20 | D108 条件性 GO：TCN σ=0.2 @125K 全程 NVE<1.0× + eval 达基线 | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02, exp_027_tcn_walker_s0, exp_028_rave_walker_s0 |\\\\n| D108 | 2026-05-20 | C8 硬截止：5/22 go/no-go，5/25 数据锁定；bjb1-40020 改为替代超参（T | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0, exp_028_rave_walker_s0, exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02, exp_028_rave_walker_s0_ceil15 |\\\\n| D107 | 2026-05-20 | 从 backward-pass（梯度级）干预转向 forward-pass 干预：TCN + RAV | exp_027_tcn_walker_s0, exp_028_rave_walker_s0, exp_025_obs_sgs_walker_s1, exp_026_obs_sgs_cheetah_s0 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4016, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01C87x6XK22ZFfR1vd3R88hn","session_id":"8160c2d3-e1f0-4475-97c0-9800d500973c","uuid":"af588c42-5668-4598-ad81-d12db67b9583","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:51:29.352Z"}
